WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
Brother, thank you so much

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,440
Come on, this is the thank you fee

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,920
Thank you. You're welcome.

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,600
Then I'll take my adults to the hospital for a checkup first.

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,640
I won't bother you anymore

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,880
Brother Xiao, this must cost tens of thousands of dollars.

7
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,280
I thought you would refuse? Why should you refuse?

8
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,400
Because you do good deeds without leaving your name, and time is immortal.

9
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,960
Why don't you leave your name when you've done something good?

10
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,040
If you do good deeds, leave your name behind

11
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:21,200
Let everyone know that those who do good deeds will be rewarded

12
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,880
Good people in this world should be rewarded with good things

13
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,680
If good people are not rewarded, who would be willing to be a good person?

14
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,480
So the rule of being a good person is that you help others

15
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,080
Don't think about how others will repay you

16
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,280
But if he wants to repay you

17
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,240
You accept it calmly

18
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,400
It seems like that's really what happened

19
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,260
Let's go. After eating, go back quickly. Don't delay.

20
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,460
If people are looking for something to do and can't find us, fine

21
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,460
Please ask

22
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:42,580
I have a moving job. What are you willing to do? How much does it cost?

23
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:43,500
I can't give you much money

24
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:48,620
Help me move the whole house. It costs 400 yuan. What's there in the refrigerator? I can't do that in a color shop. Those are all heavy things.

25
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:50,380
This four hundred yuan is too little to help you grow longer, right?

26
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:52,220
At least seven or eight hundred grandma

27
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,620
Where is your home? Let's move it, young man.

28
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:56,740
I can't give you that much money anymore. It doesn't matter.

29
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:57,700
Four hundred is four hundred
